importance in explaining ranking.
Note on normalization : A common technique used to handle
disproportionate scores is normalization. For the example above,
we illustrate that attributes with high-weights post normalization
does not answer our query correctly. For our scenario, one could
normalize each attribute 𝐴𝑖using𝑡[𝑖]/𝑚𝑎𝑥𝑖, where𝑚𝑎𝑥𝑖repre-
